{title: Saved}
{artist: David J. Ferguson}
{key: D}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 90}

Verse 1
Saved from [C2] death, saved from [G] Hell, saved from [D] sin
One day [Emin] saved from the [Cmaj7] troubles I’m [D] in
Saved to [C2] serve, saved to [G] love, saved to [D] give
Saved to [Emin] follow the [Cmaj7] Christ, saved to [D] live

(Link to chorus)
[Emin] Hallelujah, [C] hallelujah, [Amin] hallelu[D]jah [B] (x2)

Chorus
I am [Emin] saved, yes I’m [C] saved, I am [G] saved  [D] [B]
I am [Emin] saved, yes I’m [C] saved, I am [G] sav[D]ed  

Verse 2
Saved from enemies dragging me down
He saved me for honour and a crown
Saved to know deepest peace, saved to see
Saved to be everything I should be

Verse 3
Saved to know satisfaction and joy
That no-one can steal or destroy
Though each day may bring tears till I die
One day He’ll wipe every tear from my eye
